   missing · seen 2× · 2 days ago
   agent-hub's unittest suite needs a short TMPDIR and
   markdown-it-py on PYTHONPATH; run it with uv, not bare
   python.

   Evidence 2 of 2 · <date>     · migrated from pi ── Next [n]

   Why the repo didn't say it
   Both failures look like code errors, and nothing in the
   repo states the TMPDIR requirement or the markdown-it-py
   dependency that only the nix build supplies; an agent would
   report 20 fake failures.

   Details
   From pkgs/agent-hub: TMPDIR=<tmp>   PYTHONPATH=. uv run
   --quiet --with markdown-it-py python -m unittest discover
   -s tests -p 'test_*.py'.
   Without a short TMPDIR the socket tests fail with "OSError:
   AF_UNIX path too long" inside a long worktree path; without
   markdown-it-py the render/features imports fail.
   Baseline: 470 tests, 1 skipped.

   Points at
   path     pkgs/agent-hub/package.nix
   command  TMPDIR=<tmp>   PYTHONPATH=. uv run --quiet --with
            markdown-it-py python -m unittest discover -s
            tests -p 'test_*.py'
   quote    “if it happens again, just wait a bit and try
            again”
   symbol   dmsSession





